{"seq":2,"slug":"auto-triage-failure","title":"失败自动分诊与修复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/quality-gates/auto-triage-failure","wordCount":905,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"失败自动分诊与修复\">失败自动分诊与修复</h1><p>测试失败是 CI 流水线中信噪比最低的信号之一。真正的 bug 引起的失败、flaky test 引起的偶发失败、环境问题引起的基础设施失败——这三类失败的外观往往相似，但处理方式截然不同。人工分诊耗时、易疲劳，且高度依赖工程师的经验积累。</p>\n<p>AI Agent 的语义理解能力恰好适合这个场景：读懂失败日志的内容、结合历史数据判断失败类型、生成可执行的修复建议，甚至在某些情况下直接提交修复 PR。</p>\n<p>本文系统描述失败自动分诊的分类模型、实现架构和工程边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>自动分诊</strong>（Auto-Triage）指 CI 失败发生时，由 AI Agent 自动读取失败日志，判断失败类型（真实 bug、flaky test、环境问题、配置错误），生成诊断报告，而非将原始日志直接暴露给工程师。</p>\n<p><strong>Flaky Test 检测</strong>是自动分诊的最高频场景。一个测试被标记为 flaky，通常需要跨多次运行的历史数据支撑：如果同一测试在过去 30 天内成功率在 80%-95% 之间（而非接近 0% 或 100%），则极有可能是 flaky。</p>\n<p><strong>根因分类</strong>（Root Cause Classification）指将失败原因归类到有限的类别集（代码变更引入的 bug、测试本身的问题、依赖服务不稳定、资源竞争/超时等），是生成有针对性修复建议的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失败分类模型\">失败分类模型</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    FAIL[CI 失败] --&gt; TRIAGE[AI 分诊 Agent]&#10;&#10;    TRIAGE --&gt; C1{失败类型}&#10;    C1 --&gt;|代码变更引入| BUG[真实 Bug]&#10;    C1 --&gt;|偶发性失败| FLAKY[Flaky Test]&#10;    C1 --&gt;|基础设施问题| INFRA[环境/基础设施失败]&#10;    C1 --&gt;|配置/依赖问题| CONFIG[配置错误]&#10;&#10;    BUG --&gt; ACTION1[生成 Bug 报告\\n+ 定位代码位置\\n+ 触发 AI 修复建议]&#10;    FLAKY --&gt; ACTION2[标记为 Flaky\\n自动重跑\\n通知测试维护者]&#10;    INFRA --&gt; ACTION3[重跑流水线\\n记录环境指标\\n告警基础设施团队]&#10;    CONFIG --&gt; ACTION4[生成配置修复 PR\\n或配置检查报告]\">flowchart TD\n    FAIL[CI 失败] --&gt; TRIAGE[AI 分诊 Agent]\n\n    TRIAGE --&gt; C1{失败类型}\n    C1 --&gt;|代码变更引入| BUG[真实 Bug]\n    C1 --&gt;|偶发性失败| FLAKY[Flaky Test]\n    C1 --&gt;|基础设施问题| INFRA[环境/基础设施失败]\n    C1 --&gt;|配置/依赖问题| CONFIG[配置错误]\n\n    BUG --&gt; ACTION1[生成 Bug 报告\\n+ 定位代码位置\\n+ 触发 AI 修复建议]\n    FLAKY --&gt; ACTION2[标记为 Flaky\\n自动重跑\\n通知测试维护者]\n    INFRA --&gt; ACTION3[重跑流水线\\n记录环境指标\\n告警基础设施团队]\n    CONFIG --&gt; ACTION4[生成配置修复 PR\\n或配置检查报告]</pre><h2 id=\"分诊-agent-的实现架构\">分诊 Agent 的实现架构</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 失败分诊的 GitHub Actions 集成&#10;jobs:&#10;  failure-triage:&#10;    if: failure()&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - name: Collect Failure Context&#10;        run: |&#10;          # 收集失败日志（截取最后 200 行，聚焦关键信息）&#10;          cat ${{ runner.temp }}/test-results.json &gt; failure_context.json&#10;&#10;          # 查询历史稳定性数据&#10;          node scripts/get-test-history.mjs \\&#10;            --failed-tests &quot;$(jq -r &#39;.failed[].name&#39; failure_context.json | tr &#39;\\n&#39; &#39;,&#39;)&quot; \\&#10;            --days 30 &gt;&gt; failure_context.json&#10;&#10;      - name: AI Triage&#10;        env:&#10;          ANTHROPIC_API_KEY: ${{ secrets.ANTHROPIC_API_KEY }}&#10;        run: |&#10;          node scripts/ai-triage.mjs \\&#10;            --context failure_context.json \\&#10;            --output triage_result.json \\&#10;            --commit ${{ github.sha }}&#10;&#10;      - name: Act on Triage Result&#10;        run: node scripts/triage-action.mjs --result triage_result.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 失败分诊的 GitHub Actions 集成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  failure-triage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">failure()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Collect Failure Context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          # 收集失败日志（截取最后 200 行，聚焦关键信息）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          cat ${{ runner.temp }}/test-results.json > failure_context.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          # 查询历史稳定性数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          node scripts/get-test-history.mjs \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --failed-tests \"$(jq -r '.failed[].name' failure_context.json | tr '\\n' ',')\" \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --days 30 >> failure_context.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">AI Triage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          ANTHROPIC_API_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.ANTHROPIC_API_KEY }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          node scripts/ai-triage.mjs \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --context failure_context.json \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --output triage_result.json \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --commit ${{ github.sha }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Act on Triage Result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">node scripts/triage-action.mjs --result triage_result.json</span></span></code></pre></div><p>核心分诊脚本逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// scripts/ai-triage.mjs&#10;const TRIAGE_PROMPT = `You are a CI failure triage expert. Analyze the failure context and classify each failing test.&#10;&#10;For each failed test, determine:&#10;1. failure_type: one of [code_bug, flaky_test, infra_failure, config_error, dependency_issue]&#10;2. confidence: 0.0-1.0 (how confident you are in the classification)&#10;3. root_cause: specific explanation of what went wrong&#10;4. recommended_action: one of [fix_code, mark_flaky_rerun, retry_pipeline, update_config]&#10;5. fix_hint: if fix_code, provide specific guidance on where to look and what to change&#10;&#10;Use the historical stability data to inform flaky_test classification:&#10;- If success_rate_30d is between 70%-95%, likely flaky&#10;- If success_rate_30d &lt; 10% and only recently started failing, likely code_bug&#10;- If multiple unrelated tests fail simultaneously, likely infra_failure`;&#10;&#10;async function triageFailures(context) {&#10;  const result = await anthropic.messages.create({&#10;    model: &#39;claude-opus-4-5&#39;,&#10;    max_tokens: 8192,&#10;    system: TRIAGE_PROMPT,&#10;    messages: [&#10;      {&#10;        role: &#39;user&#39;,&#10;        content: `Failure context:\\n${JSON.stringify(context, null, 2)}`,&#10;      },&#10;    ],&#10;  });&#10;  return parseTriageResult(result.content[0].text);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// scripts/ai-triage.mjs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TRIAGE_PROMPT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `You are a CI failure triage expert. Analyze the failure context and classify each failing test.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">For each failed test, determine:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1. failure_type: one of [code_bug, flaky_test, infra_failure, config_error, dependency_issue]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2. confidence: 0.0-1.0 (how confident you are in the classification)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3. root_cause: specific explanation of what went wrong</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">4. recommended_action: one of [fix_code, mark_flaky_rerun, retry_pipeline, update_config]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5. fix_hint: if fix_code, provide specific guidance on where to look and what to change</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Use the historical stability data to inform flaky_test classification:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">- If success_rate_30d is between 70%-95%, likely flaky</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">- If success_rate_30d &#x3C; 10% and only recently started failing, likely code_bug</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">- If multiple unrelated tests fail simultaneously, likely infra_failure`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> triageFailures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> anthropic.messages.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'claude-opus-4-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    max_tokens: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8192</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    system: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TRIAGE_PROMPT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    messages: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        content: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Failure context:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">context</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseTriageResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result.content[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].text);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"flaky-test-自动处理\">Flaky Test 自动处理</h2><p>Flaky test 是 CI 效率的主要杀手，2026 年的工具生态已有较成熟的自动处理模式：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    FAIL[测试失败] --&gt; HIST{查询历史\\n稳定性}&#10;    HIST --&gt;|success_rate 70-95%| FLAKY_DETECT[判定为 Flaky]&#10;    HIST --&gt;|success_rate &lt; 10%| BUG_DETECT[判定为真实 Bug]&#10;&#10;    FLAKY_DETECT --&gt; RERUN[自动重跑最多 3 次]&#10;    RERUN --&gt;|重跑通过| QUARANTINE[标记为 Flaky\\n加入隔离名单]&#10;    RERUN --&gt;|重跑仍失败| INVESTIGATE[升级为真实失败\\n通知测试维护者]&#10;&#10;    QUARANTINE --&gt; ISSUE[自动创建 GitHub Issue\\n分配给测试负责人\\n设置 2 周修复 SLA]&#10;    BUG_DETECT --&gt; BLOCK[阻断 CI\\n通知 PR 作者]\">flowchart LR\n    FAIL[测试失败] --&gt; HIST{查询历史\\n稳定性}\n    HIST --&gt;|success_rate 70-95%| FLAKY_DETECT[判定为 Flaky]\n    HIST --&gt;|success_rate &lt; 10%| BUG_DETECT[判定为真实 Bug]\n\n    FLAKY_DETECT --&gt; RERUN[自动重跑最多 3 次]\n    RERUN --&gt;|重跑通过| QUARANTINE[标记为 Flaky\\n加入隔离名单]\n    RERUN --&gt;|重跑仍失败| INVESTIGATE[升级为真实失败\\n通知测试维护者]\n\n    QUARANTINE --&gt; ISSUE[自动创建 GitHub Issue\\n分配给测试负责人\\n设置 2 周修复 SLA]\n    BUG_DETECT --&gt; BLOCK[阻断 CI\\n通知 PR 作者]</pre><p>Flaky test 隔离的数据库 schema：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE flaky_tests (&#10;  id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  test_name TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  test_file TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  first_detected_at TIMESTAMP,&#10;  last_seen_at TIMESTAMP,&#10;  occurrence_count INTEGER DEFAULT 1,&#10;  status TEXT CHECK(status IN (&#39;active&#39;, &#39;fixed&#39;, &#39;suppressed&#39;)),&#10;  assigned_to TEXT,&#10;  fix_deadline DATE,&#10;  notes TEXT&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 自动检测 flaky：过去 30 天内成功率在 70-95% 之间&#10;CREATE VIEW flaky_candidates AS&#10;SELECT&#10;  test_name,&#10;  COUNT(*) AS total_runs,&#10;  SUM(CASE WHEN passed THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS passed_runs,&#10;  ROUND(100.0 * SUM(CASE WHEN passed THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) / COUNT(*), 2) AS success_rate&#10;FROM test_runs&#10;WHERE executed_at &gt; NOW() - INTERVAL &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY test_name&#10;HAVING success_rate BETWEEN 70 AND 95;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> flaky_tests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  test_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  test_file </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  first_detected_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  last_seen_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  occurrence_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'active'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fixed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'suppressed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  assigned_to </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fix_deadline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  notes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 自动检测 flaky：过去 30 天内成功率在 70-95% 之间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> flaky_candidates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  test_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_runs,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> passed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> passed_runs,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> passed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> success_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> test_runs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> executed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> test_name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> success_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 70</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ai-辅助修复建议\">AI 辅助修复建议</h2><p>对于分类为 <code>code_bug</code> 的失败，agent 可以进一步生成具体的修复建议：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"async function generateFixHint(failure, failedCode) {&#10;  const prompt = `A test is failing with the following error:&#10;Test: ${failure.test_name}&#10;Error: ${failure.error_message}&#10;Stack trace: ${failure.stack_trace}&#10;&#10;Relevant code:&#10;${failedCode}&#10;&#10;Provide:&#10;1. Root cause explanation (2-3 sentences)&#10;2. Specific fix suggestion with code snippet if possible&#10;3. Whether this might affect other tests or functionality`;&#10;&#10;  const response = await anthropic.messages.create({&#10;    model: &#39;claude-sonnet-4-5&#39;,&#10;    max_tokens: 2048,&#10;    messages: [{ role: &#39;user&#39;, content: prompt }],&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return response.content[0].text;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateFixHint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">failure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">failedCode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `A test is failing with the following error:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Test: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">failure</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">test_name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Error: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">failure</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">error_message</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Stack trace: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">failure</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stack_trace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Relevant code:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">failedCode</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Provide:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1. Root cause explanation (2-3 sentences)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2. Specific fix suggestion with code snippet if possible</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3. Whether this might affect other tests or functionality`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> anthropic.messages.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'claude-sonnet-4-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    max_tokens: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2048</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    messages: [{ role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, content: prompt }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.content[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].text;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>修复建议的质量取决于传入的上下文质量。参见 <a href=\"../foundations/ai-friendly-pipeline-design\">AI 友好的流水线设计</a> 了解如何构建高质量的失败上下文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分诊结果的路由与行动\">分诊结果的路由与行动</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分诊结果</th>\n<th>置信度</th>\n<th>自动行动</th>\n<th>人工通知</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>code_bug</td>\n<td>&gt; 0.8</td>\n<td>阻断 CI，在 PR 上标注失败原因</td>\n<td>通知 PR 作者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>code_bug</td>\n<td>0.5-0.8</td>\n<td>阻断 CI</td>\n<td>通知 PR 作者 + 团队 oncall</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>flaky_test</td>\n<td>&gt; 0.7</td>\n<td>自动重跑，标记 flaky</td>\n<td>创建 Issue，分配给测试负责人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>infra_failure</td>\n<td>&gt; 0.8</td>\n<td>自动重跑流水线</td>\n<td>通知基础设施团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>config_error</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>生成配置修复建议</td>\n<td>通知平台团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>置信度 &lt; 0.5</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>无自动操作</td>\n<td>发送分诊报告，人工判断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>低置信度时不自动行动是重要的安全边界——宁可回落到人工处理，也不要让误判的自动操作放大问题。</p>\n<p>关于失败分诊在流水线中的触发时机，参见 <a href=\"../foundations/agent-in-pipeline-patterns\">Agent 嵌入流水线的触发模式</a>。关于测试生成如何在下游减少失败数量，参见 <a href=\"test-generation-maintenance\">测试生成与维护</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>失败自动分诊将原始 CI 失败信号转化为有结构的诊断报告：真实 bug 直接定位代码位置并给出修复建议，flaky test 自动重跑并进入隔离管理，基础设施失败重跑流水线并通知运维。Flaky test 检测依赖历史稳定性数据（30 天内成功率 70-95% 为 flaky 特征）。低置信度（&lt; 0.5）时不做自动行动，回落人工是保守但正确的安全边界。分诊能力的上限由失败上下文的质量决定——结构化日志和语义化错误信息是前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"失败自动分诊与修复","id":"失败自动分诊与修复"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"失败分类模型","id":"失败分类模型"},{"level":2,"text":"分诊 Agent 的实现架构","id":"分诊-agent-的实现架构"},{"level":2,"text":"Flaky Test 自动处理","id":"flaky-test-自动处理"},{"level":2,"text":"AI 辅助修复建议","id":"ai-辅助修复建议"},{"level":2,"text":"分诊结果的路由与行动","id":"分诊结果的路由与行动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CI 中的 AI 代码审查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/quality-gates/ai-code-review-in-ci"},"next":{"title":"测试生成与维护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/quality-gates/test-generation-maintenance"}}